## 🧠 The Practical Action Plan to Start Right Now
To separate yourself from the 1,000 researchers who failed before you, change your hunting routine today: [9] 

   1. Turn off automated vulnerability scanners. They generate noise, trigger WAF blocks, and cause you to miss structural logic. [10] 
   2. Pick one single feature context (for example, Currency Conversion or Voucher Codes). Spend 3 full days analyzing only that feature.
   3. Read the documentation of the third-party integrations they use. If you see they use a specific payment gateway, look up that gateway's API documentation online to see how it handles signatures and order verification.
   4. Use Burp Suite manually to slow down, manipulate, and intercept every single parameter—especially nested JSON arrays and obscure HTTP headers.

